# This working folder also contains several GB of private experiment backups,
# downloaded tools, drivers, game files and logs. Publish only the curated
# source/documentation paths explicitly allowed below.
*

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!AGENTS.md

!docs/
!docs/**
!games/
!games/**
!examples/
!examples/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!templates/
!templates/**
!evidence/
!evidence/**
!preferences/
!preferences/**

# Never publish generated or third-party binaries, even if placed in an
# allowed directory by mistake.
*.7z
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.zip
*.bak
*.dmp
